{
  "version": "keel.enforcement_state_vectors.v1",
  "description": "Golden vectors for Work enforcement state. Three facts stay separate and are never derived from one another: the regime a Permit was ISSUED under (permit_enforcement_state_v1), the regime resolved at the pre-effect gate for one DISPATCH attempt (runtime_enforcement_proof v2), and the project's CURRENT configuration, which is live state and appears in no signed artifact. runtime_enforcement_proof v1 remains valid for historical dispatches, where the regime reads as not recorded.",
